{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19857","headline":"乱离 · 孟郊","name":"乱离","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"天下无义剑，中原多疮痍。\n哀哀陆大夫，正直神反欺。\n子路已成血，嵇康今尚嗤。\n爲君每一恸，如剑在四肢。\n折羽不复飞，逝水不复归。\n直松摧高柯，弱蔓将何依。\n朝爲春日欢，夕爲秋日悲。\n泪下无尺寸，纷纷天雨丝。\n积怨成疾疹，积恨成狂痴。\n怨草岂有边，恨水岂有涯。\n怨恨驰我心，茫茫日何之。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟郊","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19857.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19857","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}